c=AdlVk72C9dszuW5GRlg8ugp9SI3Qf3hbcI5S5qxIGM6_kitP_qgKCyv59k-CHo7yPzQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGEW_kOJWUhAGwZD_SG6qje11dCQkd4lyCn38JdJ4asA&oe=69A1A6AF"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2031682293901788", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570314_2031682300568454_7181790668181460473_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XlmEQJKRtrsQ7kNvwErFLNm&_nc_oc=AdlyVz5IemAaWrSOFSul1OKcwrl9n2bH1tuOheAwSlxARiEEMFu68UXBSf7ms5vQi-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs_iaQSbCNok6qTmn1n_6FIqWok_1GSFhFjQPsjv7wczA&oe=69A17648"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1182641809455371", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982685_1182641812788704_4892425978473987963_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jhi8GEotRp4Q7kNvwFm0eOi&_nc_oc=AdmC1SvFG-HYvFSTg62k5MIZ1INVlAklkSroxfOgTUztVxgYHSHDYg_Cu7SasnavZZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftDYwhy937oWoQv-9d9mGDIfZ72pHkLUJCXxaU45NfgOQ&oe=69A18726"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "7747279352020652", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610710_7747279362020651_5612876263433505548_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uD3VCwxuEncQ7kNvwFaDe3T&_nc_oc=Adn3cfdx4GC81RzPckaboPu-9z-r-XnQcxGYPdX0wxZ4oZUlmrggKrsJkszc1ssIuqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuL4-eLn82AKQsaoRqMAo7tOOI7LfNaOJDqpSg2A2W2ig&oe=69A1A51A"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "runner", "ninja", "void"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n \n\u2795**21 Level-Stages** designed to test your reflexes, agility, and quick thinking.\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Void Ninja is an action platformer game that blends runner elements with a unique \u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion system. \n\nLocomotion x Controls. \nJust one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!\nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow & help your enemies to meet your katanas.\n\nStep into the shoes of a hero who races forward through a treacherous void, armed with 2 fast katanas and razor-sharp reflexes."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman Yakimenko", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://void-ninja.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_servic